{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01098",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.13,
      "end_seconds": 4.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.14,
      "end_seconds": 7.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.9,
      "end_seconds": 10.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.64,
      "end_seconds": 31.95,
      "duration_seconds": 19.31,
      "text": "Yeah, it's drenching night sweats. I don't know what's causing it. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.84,
      "end_seconds": 36.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.87,
      "end_seconds": 55.86,
      "duration_seconds": 16.99,
      "text": "I, I'd say six months. Actually, no, closer to about three months. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.22,
      "end_seconds": 60.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.22,
      "end_seconds": 63.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I'd say on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.87,
      "end_seconds": 69.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "So, have you been losing weight without trying?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.8,
      "end_seconds": 73.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Yeah, um, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.89,
      "end_seconds": 79.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Has there been a cough that won't go too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.8,
      "end_seconds": 84.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Yes, for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.98,
      "end_seconds": 90.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Have you noticed bone pain or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.66,
      "end_seconds": 96.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Oh, no, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.88,
      "end_seconds": 98.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "How about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.93,
      "end_seconds": 100.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No fever, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.65,
      "end_seconds": 105.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.03,
      "end_seconds": 111.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.0,
      "end_seconds": 124.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.81,
      "end_seconds": 126.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.18,
      "end_seconds": 144.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.42,
      "end_seconds": 147.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.2,
      "end_seconds": 150.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.3,
      "end_seconds": 171.16,
      "duration_seconds": 18.86,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.14,
      "end_seconds": 183.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.07,
      "end_seconds": 187.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I have an enlarged prostate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.65,
      "end_seconds": 191.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.2,
      "end_seconds": 196.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "No, um, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 201.58,
      "end_seconds": 216.11,
      "duration_seconds": 14.53,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse 68, respiratory rate 16, weight 70 kilos, temp 36.6 degrees, height 157 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, BMI works out to 28.4, BP is 110 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.05,
      "end_seconds": 219.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.36,
      "end_seconds": 224.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.05,
      "end_seconds": 226.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.71,
      "end_seconds": 250.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "There is a firm, painless lump in the left side of your neck about three centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.92,
      "end_seconds": 254.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Yes, you know, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.97,
      "end_seconds": 277.69,
      "duration_seconds": 17.72,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is symptoms that need an urgent cancer work-up. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.31,
      "end_seconds": 280.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.79,
      "end_seconds": 313.05,
      "duration_seconds": 31.26,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's symptoms that need an urgent cancer work-up, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. I think blood tests makes sense here, for weight loss. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I am referring you on an urgent pathway, which means an appointment within two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.48,
      "end_seconds": 329.58,
      "duration_seconds": 15.1,
      "text": "Let's hold off on an ultrasound of the neck for now, and if there's no change next month we can revisit it. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.58,
      "end_seconds": 334.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.48,
      "end_seconds": 344.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the scans. Alright, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.99,
      "end_seconds": 347.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}